# Vouched contributors for pleno-dlp.
#
# This project handles secret material — only vouched contributors may
# open PRs or issues. Maintainers vouch for new contributors by
# commenting "vouch" on an issue authored by the candidate.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One handle per line (without @), sorted alphabetically.
#  - platform:username to scope to a forge (e.g. github:user).
#  - Prefix with minus to denounce: -username or -platform:username.
#  - Optional reason after a space following the handle.
HikaruEgashira
